WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Jamie holds the drink while Ryu remains stunned.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.250
The HUD shows level 3 after the held drink.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:02.600
Jamie uses the newly unlocked OD Tenshin.

4
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.900
OD Tenshin connects against the stunned Ryu.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.450
Crouching heavy punch continues after the command throw.

6
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.850
OD Palm launches the corner juggle.

7
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.600
The target kick continues into the drink finish.

8
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.000
The final follow-up reaches drink level 4.
